# Exclusions for the Link check workflow (.github/workflows/link-check.yml).
# One regular expression per line, matched against the URL. Every entry says why.
# tel: and mailto: are excluded in the workflow's lychee args.

# Placeholder, not a link: the citation template in
# family-court-metric-catalog/docs/README.md says "github.com/[org]/..." for the
# reader to fill in.
^https://github\.com/\[org\]/

# BROKEN — needs a human (found 2026-10-18). The coercive-control README points
# contributors to an issue template that does not exist in this repository
# (family-court-metric-catalog/docs/07-coercive-control/README.md, line 47).
# Someone needs to restore the template or say where CC issues should go.
family-court-metric-catalog/\.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/coercive-control\.md$
